                _M_A_S_T_E_R___S_I_T_E___O_V_E_R_R_I_D_E and _M_A_S_T_E_R___S_I_T_E___B_A_C_K_U_P.

     cchheecckkssuumm   Verify that the fetched distfile's checksum matches the one
                the port was tested against.  If the distfile's checksum does
                not match, it also fetches the distfiles which are missing or
